    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDry Dock is a very attractive three bedroom detached home located in the townsland of Tenacre, Kilrane, just 5 minutes from Rosslare Harbour and approximately 20 minutes south of Wexford Town.\n\nExtending to approximately 185 sq.m., the accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, spacious reception room, kitchen/dining room, utility room, three bedrooms (one ensuite) and a main bathroom to the ground floor. It also has a second reception room to the first floor accessed via a feature spiral staircase. \n\nThe property has been lovingly developed along nautical lines, in keeping with its coastal location, and benefits from oil fired central heating.\n\nOutside there is a generous west facing rear garden, complete with a garden shed, perfect for enjoying the afternoon and evening sun. The property also benefits from a convenient side entrance providing access to the rear garden.\n\nThe property is presented to the market in good condition and offers an excellent opportunity to acquire an attractive family home or investment property in a highly desirable location. Attractive Architecture with its distinctive tower house / lighthouse inspired design.\n\nLocated within easy access of of Rosslare Harbour Village which offers a supermarket, pharmacy, and a range of other retail outlets, along with several food options and traditional pubs. There are also a number of primary schools in the surrounding area. The beautiful beaches of St. Helen's, Rosslare Strand and Carne are just a short drive away.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nVirtual tour available online."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.91m x 4.52m\nBright open plan hallway.\n\nInner Hall - 5.74m x 3.4m\nBright open plan with spiral stairs to first floor living area.\n\nKitchen - 3.72m x 1.62m\nBespoke fitted kitchen units. Tiled floors.\n\nUtility Room - 2.24m x 1.62m\nFitted unit, plumbed for washing machine, door to rear yard/garden.\n\nBathroom - 3.26m 1.87m\nWith wc whb shower, tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom - 4.3m x 4.4m\nDouble room.\n\nBedroom - 4.79m x 4.33m\nLarge Double.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.13m x 4.77m\nMain Bedroom with adjoining ensuite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 3.83m x 3.45m\nWith wc whb Bath.\n\nLiving Room ground floor - 6.10m x 5.56m\nOpen plan living area.\n\n1st Floor - \n\n\nReception Rom - 6.8m x 4.76m\nFirst floor living area.\n\nOutside - \nGarden in lawn, beach pebble driveway, feature Stone entrance with steel gates.\n\n"
